# PulseWatch by OrangeCloud project rules

- Start by reading `AGENTS.md`, `BUILD_STATUS.md`, `CURSOR_START_HERE.md`, and `docs/BUILD_HANDOFF_INDEX.md`.
- Product name is **PulseWatch**; endorsed brand is **PulseWatch by OrangeCloud**. See `docs/BRAND_KIT.md`.
- This is a commercial multi-tenant social-listening SaaS deployed on Cloudflare.
- Production hostname: `reputation.orangecloud.vn` (technical DNS; not the product display name).
- Production deployment target: Cloudflare account **Cloudspace**. Never hardcode account IDs in runtime source.
- Core user outcome: newest relevant mentions plus fast, high-precision negative alerts.
- Core SLO: P95 important supported-source negative alert < 15 minutes.
- Plans: technical entitlement keys only (`starter` / `pro` / `business`) with public labels PulseWatch Starter / Pro / Business; commercial pricing is not stored in-repo. Explicit internal `super_admin` bypasses commercial quotas only and is never a public plan.
- Never fake unavailable platform/source coverage.
- Prefer small, reviewable patches and preserve existing conventions.
- Do not rename worker/queue/DO/KV technical identifiers (`reputa-*`) unless a dedicated migration is planned.
